sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant A as Agent
    participant CE as ContextEngineer
    participant S as Shared State
    participant M as Memory Store
    participant MCP as MCP Client
    participant LLM as Model

    U->>A: demande
    A->>CE: build(goal, policy)
    CE->>S: read task state
    CE->>M: fetch relevant memory
    CE->>MCP: list/read resources
    CE->>CE: filter, dedupe, rank, budget
    CE-->>A: context pack
    A->>LLM: prompt + context pack
    LLM-->>A: answer or tool call
    A->>CE: write audit trace
